.Dd November 5, 2026
.Dt NOSTROMO-DOCS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nostromo-docs
.Nd read local programming manuals and examples
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Cm menu
.Nm
.Cm c | cpp | man | go | go-examples | python | examples | guide
.Ar topic
.Nm
.Cm rust
.Ar book | std | reference | rust-by-example | embedded-book
.Nm
.Cm llvm | freebsd | --check
.Nm
.Cm language
.Ar c | cpp
.Nm
.Cm python-book
.Ar tutorial | reference | library | c-api | extending | howto | using | whatsnew
.Nm
.Cm go-language | kicad-cli | versions
.Nm
.Cm kicad
.Op Ar kicad | eeschema | pcbnew | gerbview | pcb_calculator | pl_editor | getting_started_in_kicad
.Sh DESCRIPTION
With no arguments,
.Nm
opens a terminal topic picker.
.Cm menu
opens the graphical picker and launches a separate documentation window.
Manuals and Markdown examples use the terminal pager.
Rust books and the
.Fx
Handbook open local HTML in qutebrowser.
The C/C++ archive, Go specification, Python books and KiCad manuals also use
local HTML. The versions action reports installed toolchains and the dated
cppreference snapshot. The Rust picker includes the books actually present in
the selected compiler's sysroot, including Cargo, rustc, rustdoc and Clippy.
.Pp
The
.Cm examples
topics are c, cpp, rust, go, python, shell, assembly, vis and zephyr.
Code blocks keep their indentation.
No example is executed by the reader.
.Pp
Go queries disable module and toolchain downloads.
Python library queries read the installed text manual without importing modules.
Install the documentation packages while online before using this command
offline.
.Ss Keys
Use j and k to scroll, / to search, n for the next result and q to close
the pager.
Left and right scroll long example lines.
In vis, Space od opens the documentation menu.
In dvtm, Ctrl+B d opens a documentation pane.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.local/share/nostromo/reference
Markdown examples shipped with the dotfiles.
.It Pa ~/.local/share/nostromo/OFFLINE-DOCS.md
Installed references, commands and update instructions.
.It Pa ~/.local/share/man
Manual pages for the locally built desktop programs.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
nostromo-docs c malloc
nostromo-docs cpp std::vector
nostromo-docs go fmt.Printf
nostromo-docs go-examples fmt
nostromo-docs python pathlib
nostromo-docs examples assembly
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr apropos 1 ,
.Xr man 1 ,
.Xr mandoc 1
